ction":"publication","summary":"Review proposing mesenchymal drift as a unifying framework that converges the molecular hallmarks of aging, linking loss of cellular identity, stromal remodeling, and age-associated inflammation across tissues and diseases.","tags":[],"title":"Mesenchymal drift: A convergent framework for the hallmarks of aging","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Lu, J. Y. et al."],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1756684800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1756684800,"objectID":"3158118009909586f250339ebd861bca","permalink":"https://THU-AntiAging.github.io/zh/publication/lu-2025-comparative-proteomics/","publishdate":"2025-09-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/lu-2025-comparative-proteomics/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Comparative Proteomics Reveals Hallmarks of Mammalian Lifespan Control","type":"publication"},{"authors":["admin"],"categories":null,"content":"我们很高兴在清华大学医学院正式成立衰老与年轻化实验室（Aging \u0026amp; Rejuvenation Lab, ARL）。\n我们正在招聘有志于衰老生物学、表观遗传学或计算基因组学方向的研究生和博士后。如感兴趣，欢迎联系我们。\n","date":1756684800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1756684800,"objectID":"a7e7ae9e26d2e898c8197f512e5ce4bb","permalink":"https://THU-AntiAging.github.io/zh/post/2025-09-01-welcome/","publishdate":"2025-09-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/post/2025-09-01-welcome/","section":"post","summary":"我们很高兴在清华大学医学院正式成立衰老与年轻化实验室（Aging \u0026 Rejuvenation Lab, ARL）。\n","tags":["实验室"],"title":"欢迎来到衰老与年轻化实验室","type":"post"},{"authors":["Lu, J. Y. et al."],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1753920000,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1753920000,"objectID":"2880570770ac214a3b7c3ea789537228","permalink":"https://THU-AntiAging.github.io/zh/publication/lu-2025-cell-mesenchymal-drift/","publishdate":"2025-07-31T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/lu-2025-cell-mesenchymal-drift/","section":"publication","summary":"Identified mesenchymal drift as a prevale